      "writtenOn": "2025-10-28T04:21:15Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "My thought process was that if it\u0027s in android-mainline, these changes can be automatically pulled into each respective androidX-6.X branch respectively rather than having the need to manually push a change to enable Tegra soc configs for each specific kernel branch. Eg right now we might want them added to android16-6.12, but down the line would want them in android17-6.18. So wouldn\u0027t it be easier if they\u0027re automatically pulled in rather than pushed manually for each branch?\nWhat\u0027s your opinion",
      "parentUuid": "32a721d8_93085921",
      "revId": "ffb98f95734dcc1ba93b1cbdc0d18444cc958bf6",
      "serverId": "85c56323-6fa9-3386-8a01-6480fb634889"
    },
