      "message": "It could in theory, but we would like it built-in so that we have access to early uart output and kernel boot logs. If we build and load it as a vendor-module we\u0027ll miss early printk output and only see logs once the module is inserted. Those early debug logs can be essential for debugging some issues or kernel panics before init.",
